OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked with petrol bombs
OL,4,Aduring 'orchestrated' disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police have been attacked with
OL,7,Fpetrol bombs during trouble involving
OL,8,Fup to 50 masked people in Londonderry.
OL,10,FA senior officer said the disorder in
OL,11,Fthe Waterside on Monday night was
OL,12,Forchestrated and some of those involved
OL,13,Fhad weapons.
OL,15,FSupt Sinead McIldowney described the
OL,16,Ftrouble in the Knockwellan Park, Trench
OL,17,FRoad and Strabane Old Road areas as
OL,18,F"absolutely disgraceful".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
